"Fast live text sends meeting audio while the live preview runs, with your name from Settings → Autocomplete as a spelling hint. Voices and calendar email addresses stay on this Mac. The same approval covers Think if you point it at this server." = "快速即時逐字稿會在即時逐字稿預覽執行期間傳送會議音訊，並附上你在「設定 → 自動完成」中填寫的姓名作為拼寫提示。聲音和行事曆中的電子郵件地址會留在這台 Mac 上。若你將思考模型指向此伺服器，此核准同樣適用於思考模型。";
"Fast live text: send meeting audio to Muse Voice Transcribe 1.0" = "快速即時逐字稿：將會議音訊傳送到 Muse Voice Transcribe 1.0";
"While the live transcript preview runs, streams the microphone and call audio to Muse Voice Transcribe 1.0, which returns each turn's text about a second after it ends. Without it, the preview transcribes 12-second chunks on this Mac. Who said what still comes from your microphone and the call track, never from Muse. Costs about $0.36 per meeting hour for the two tracks." = "即時逐字稿預覽執行期間，會將麥克風和通話音訊串流傳送到 Muse Voice Transcribe 1.0，它會在每段發言結束後約一秒傳回該段的文字。未開啟時，預覽會在這台 Mac 上以 12 秒為一段進行轉錄。誰說了什麼仍由你的麥克風和通話音軌判斷，絕不來自 Muse。兩條音軌每會議小時的費用約為 $0.36。";
"Turn-by-turn live text" = "逐段發言即時逐字稿";
"While the live transcript preview runs, cuts the microphone and call audio at pauses and transcribes each turn with your Transcribe model, so its text appears about a second after the speaker stops. Live Radar then reads after each turn. Without it, the preview transcribes a few seconds at a time." = "即時逐字稿預覽執行期間，會在停頓處切分麥克風和通話音訊，並用你的轉錄模型逐段轉錄每段發言，因此發言者停下約一秒後就會顯示這段文字。即時雷達隨後會在每段發言之後讀取。未開啟時，預覽每次轉錄幾秒鐘的音訊。";
"Answer meeting questions from your screen" = "根據你的螢幕回答會議中的問題";
"When Live Radar catches a question, LokalBot searches your screen memory on this Mac for captures that mention it, crops each to the rows that do, and gives your Think model the text of up to three crops with their app, window title, and time. An answer is shown only when its quote is in the crop's own text. Screenshots and the search stay on this Mac." = "當即時雷達捕捉到問題時，LokalBot 會在這台 Mac 上的螢幕記憶中搜尋提及該問題的擷取內容，將每張裁切到提及該問題的那幾列，並將最多三張裁切圖中的文字連同其 App、視窗標題和時間交給你的思考模型。只有在答案的引文出現在裁切圖本身的文字中時，才會顯示該答案。螢幕截圖和搜尋過程都會留在這台 Mac 上。";
"Fast. About 3 s per radar pass." = "快速。每輪雷達分析約 3 秒。";
"Strongest reasoning and tool use. About 6 s per radar pass." = "推理與工具使用能力最強。每輪雷達分析約 6 秒。";
"Meta's terms for your Model API account apply. Content sent while you use free credits may be used to improve Meta's products, so record only people who agreed." = "你的 Model API 帳號適用 Meta 的條款。使用免費額度時傳送的內容可能會被用於改進 Meta 的產品，因此請只錄製已同意的人。";
