"When Live Radar catches a question or a problem, your Think model looks for the answer in your work: first what LokalBot remembers (your projects and where they stand, your open actions, what you told it about yourself), then your meetings, what you saw on screen, and the folders below. It is given the question, the last few lines, what LokalBot remembers that bears on it, and the parts of meetings, screen text, documents, and code it reads. An answer is shown only when its sources contain the words it quotes." = "即時雷達捕捉到問題或難題時,你的思考模型會在你的工作內容中尋找答案:先看 LokalBot 記住的內容(你的專案及進展、未完成的行動項、你告訴它的關於你自己的資訊),再看你的會議、你在螢幕上看到的內容,以及下方的資料夾。它會收到問題、最近幾行內容、LokalBot 記住的相關內容,以及它讀取到的會議、螢幕文字、文件和程式碼片段。只有當來源中確實包含答案所引用的原話時,才會顯示該答案。";
"Documents, sheets, and PDFs in these folders can be read. In a git repository it also reads tracked code, recent commits, and pull requests and issues through the GitHub CLI. Hidden files, untracked files, and secrets such as .env files and keys are never read." = "這些資料夾中的文件、試算表和 PDF 可以被讀取。在 git 儲存庫中,還會透過 GitHub CLI 讀取已追蹤的程式碼、最近的提交,以及拉取請求和議題。隱藏檔案、未追蹤檔案,以及 .env 檔案和金鑰等機密內容絕不會被讀取。";
