"Until LokalBot has a verified Google app, Gmail uses your own OAuth client. In Google Cloud, enable the Gmail API, create an OAuth client of type Desktop app, set the app's publishing status to In production so the sign-in doesn't expire after a week, download the client's JSON file, and choose it here." = "在 LokalBot 取得通過驗證的 Google 應用程式之前，Gmail 會使用你自己的 OAuth 用戶端。請在 Google Cloud 中啟用 Gmail API，建立類型為「電腦版應用程式」的 OAuth 用戶端，將應用程式的發布狀態設為「正式版」，以免登入在一週後失效，接著下載用戶端的 JSON 檔案，並在這裡選擇該檔案。";
"Disconnected here, but Google didn't confirm it. You can also remove LokalBot's access in your Google Account settings." = "已在這裡中斷連線，但 Google 未確認。你也可以在 Google 帳戶設定中移除 LokalBot 的存取權。";
"What LokalBot reads" = "LokalBot 讀取的內容";
"LokalBot reads headers first and downloads a conversation only if you wrote in it, or if someone on your calendar takes part and it isn't bulk mail. It never reads Spam, Trash, or Drafts, and it keeps attachment names but never their contents. It checks for new mail at launch, every few hours, each morning, and before meetings. Google's read-only permission means LokalBot can't send, delete, or change mail." = "LokalBot 會先讀取郵件標頭，只有當你曾在對話串中寫信，或行事曆中的人有參與且不是大量寄送的郵件時，才會下載該對話串。它絕不讀取垃圾郵件、垃圾桶或草稿，附件只保留名稱，絕不保留內容。它會在啟動時、每隔幾小時、每天早上及會議開始前檢查新郵件。由於 Google 授予的是唯讀權限，LokalBot 無法傳送、刪除或變更郵件。";
