"LokalBot asks Google for read-only access to Gmail. It downloads conversations you wrote in and mail with people on your calendar from the last 90 days, and uses them to brief you before meetings with those people. Mail stays encrypted on this Mac and is never sent to LokalBot or anyone else. Disconnecting deletes it." = "LokalBot 會向 Google 要求 Gmail 的唯讀存取權。它會下載過去 90 天內你寫過信的對話串，以及與行事曆中的人往來的郵件，並在你與這些人開會前為你提供簡報。郵件會加密儲存在這台 Mac 上，絕不會傳送給 LokalBot 或其他任何人。中斷連線後，這些郵件會被刪除。";
