"LokalBot reads the folders you choose and keeps an index of their text, pictures and sound in its library. Nothing leaves this Mac. The first time, it downloads EmbeddingGemma 2's image model (555 MB). Turning Files off deletes the index." = "LokalBot 會讀取你選擇的資料夾，並在資料庫中保存其文字、圖片和聲音的索引。任何資料都不會離開這台 Mac。第一次開啟時，會下載 EmbeddingGemma 2 的影像模型（555 MB）。關閉「檔案」會刪除索引。";
