"LokalBot reads only the folders listed here: pictures and screenshots, PDFs page by page, and documents such as txt, md, rtf, docx, odt and html. It skips hidden folders, app bundles, caches, code projects (except their screenshots), folders that look like datasets, and iCloud files that are not downloaded. With recordings and video included, sound is read 30 seconds at a time and video a frame per shot, so a search can open the moment in LokalBot's player. The index keeps each file's path, its text, and a vector of what it says, shows or sounds like, in the LokalBot library. The image and text model downloads once and runs only while new or changed files are read. Reading pauses while a meeting records, in Low Power Mode, and while the Mac is warm. While you use the Mac, a folder's first read goes at about a third of full speed, and at full speed once you step away. On battery it waits for a charger unless Read big folders on battery is on." = "LokalBot 只會讀取這裡列出的資料夾：圖片和螢幕截圖、逐頁讀取的 PDF，以及 txt、md、rtf、docx、odt 和 html 等文件。它會略過隱藏的資料夾、App 套件、快取、程式碼專案（其中的螢幕截圖除外）、看起來像資料集的資料夾，以及尚未下載的 iCloud 檔案。包含錄音和影片時，聲音每次讀取 30 秒，影片每個鏡頭讀取一格畫面，因此搜尋結果可在 LokalBot 的播放器中打開對應時刻。索引會在 LokalBot 資料庫中保存每個檔案的路徑、文字，以及代表其內容、畫面或聲音的向量。影像和文字模型只會下載一次，且僅在讀取新的或已變更的檔案時執行。會議錄製期間、「低耗電模式」下以及 Mac 溫度較高時，讀取會暫停。你使用 Mac 時，資料夾的首次讀取會以全速的約三分之一進行；你離開後則會全速進行。使用電池時，除非已開啟「使用電池時也讀取大型資料夾」，否則會等到接上充電器再讀取。";
"Search by meaning also matches what captured screens show. The first such search downloads EmbeddingGemma 2's image model (555 MB); picture vectors are deleted with the pixels." = "語意搜尋也會比對擷取的螢幕畫面中顯示的內容。首次進行此類搜尋時會下載 EmbeddingGemma 2 的影像模型（555 MB）；影像向量會隨畫面像素一併刪除。";
